ex-forward = Forward pass — the earliest it can start:
ex-early-bound =  { $source }: no start before { $at }.
ex-early-via =  { $source }: no finish before { $via }, so no start before { $at }.
ex-early-mandatory =  { $source } overrides the rest: start { $at }.
ex-earliest = The latest of these is { $at }.
ex-placed = Its calendar ({ $calendar }) doesn't work then: the next working morning, { $at }.
ex-early-finish = { $n } working days on { $calendar } finish it on { $at }.
ex-backward = Backward pass — the latest it can finish:
ex-late-bound =  { $source }: no finish after { $at }.
ex-late-via =  { $source }: no start after { $via }, so no finish after { $at }.
ex-late-mandatory =  { $source } overrides the rest: finish { $at }.
ex-latest = The earliest of these is { $at }.
ex-placed-late = Its calendar ({ $calendar }) doesn't work then: the last working evening before, { $at }.
ex-late-start = Counting { $n } working days back on { $calendar }, it starts at the latest on { $at }.
ex-total-float = Total float: { $n } working days on { $calendar } from the early finish to the late finish.
ex-slack = { $source }: { $n }
ex-free-float = Free float: { $n }, the least of: { $list }.
ex-held-late = As late as possible: moved { $n } working days later, by its free float.
ex-critical = On the critical path: it has no float to spare.

